  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: netty-codec-dns 4.1.100.Final-rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released io.netty:netty-codec-dns 4.1.100.Final-rhlw-00001 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-42579 and CVE-2026-73508.\n\nCVE-2026-42579: Netty: DNS Codec Input Validation Bypass in Netty (Encoder + Decoder)\n\nCVE-2026-73508: Netty: Memory Leak in DNS Record Decoder via Malformed Domain Names\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for io.netty:netty-codec-dns 4.1.100.Final from Maven Central.",
